  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ID: UNOPS - United Nations Office for Project Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(USAID Bureau for Inclusive Growth, Partnerships, and Innovation (IPI)):  This activity will provide technical support to organizations to expand the delivery of quality eye care services to vulnerable children and others with limited access to sight-saving services. It will support eye health interventions for service delivery, scale-up, research, and innovation and use a multi-faceted approach to eradicate preventable blindness. The activity contributes to the Agency&apos;s development goals and foreign policy objectives by improving resilience and leveraging partnerships. This IM implements the Child Blindness directive/earmark.</narrative>
  </description>
